    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Aftercare videos \u00b7 0\u20132y \u00b7 Turkish - T\u00fcrk\u00e7e\",\"title\":\"Turkish translation Babies and Toddlers (0-2 years old)\",\"lede\":\"Below are a few videos which we would like you to watch. They include a consultation explaining what to expect on the day of circumcision, aftercare video for the ring method, how to change the nappy and an explanation of how to clean the penis after the ring comes off. Please note that every patient is different and whilst this explanation will apply to 99% of patients, if there is anything different which your son may need, we will advise you accordingly.\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Aftercare\",\"href\":\"/aftercare/\"},{\"label\":\"0\u20132y\",\"href\":\"/babies-toddlers-circumcision-videos/\"},{\"label\":\"Turkish - T\u00fcrk\u00e7e\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><span lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>T\u00fcrk\u00e7e \u00e7eviri Bebekler ve K\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck \u00c7ocuklar (0-2 ya\u015f)</strong></span></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Please also note that this translation has been carried out using computer software and we cannot guarantee the accuracy of the translation, so please also refer to the main English videos.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><span lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\u0130zlemenizi istedi\u011fimiz birka\u00e7 videoyu a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da bulabilirsiniz. Bunlar aras\u0131nda s\u00fcnnet g\u00fcn\u00fcnde neler beklenmesi gerekti\u011fini a\u00e7\u0131klayan bir kons\u00fcltasyon, Plastibell (halka) y\u00f6ntemi i\u00e7in bak\u0131m sonras\u0131 video, bebek bezinin nas\u0131l de\u011fi\u015ftirilece\u011fi ve halka \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra penisin na